# Backup do banco de medicoes E das anotacoes (anotacoes-<data>.zip): copia consistente (API de backup do SQLite), restauracao
# de teste (abre a copia e calcula o consenso) e guarda as 30 mais novas.
# Disparado todo dia pelo boardview-backup.timer.
[Unit]
Description=Boardview - backup do banco de medicoes

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=boardview
Group=boardview
WorkingDirectory=/opt/boardview
Environment=BOARDVIEW_DADOS=/var/lib/boardview
Environment=PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /opt/boardview/medicoes_db.py backup /var/backups/boardview 30
NoNewPrivileges=yes
PrivateTmp=yes
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=yes
ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/boardview /var/backups/boardview
